{
  "$comment": "The voices characters can be given (Character.tts_voice is a key here). Each says what it is on every text-to-speech service QBL can use, under engines.<service>: for kokoro a voice id or a blend such as \"af_bella(2)+af_sky(1)\" and a speed; for openai a voice and instructions. A voice with nothing for the service in use borrows the nearest voice that has something (same language, gender, then age). See docs/src/content/docs/developers/voices.md. narrators: the default narrator's voice for each language, for scenarios that do not choose one (Scenario.narrator_voice).",
